From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: finalpantasy <finalpantasy@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 20:49:01 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 29/34] Lifter: keep XMM registers in function locals

Emitter::CacheXmm rewrites c.xmm[N] to locals X0-X15, loaded after
LIFT_ENTER, stored back after every LIFT_SPILL and reloaded after every
LIFT_RELOAD, so guest stores through B no longer force XMM reloads from
Ctx. SWARC_NO_XMM_LOCALS=1 at lift time turns it off. VZEROALL clears all
16 slots and fxsave/fxrstor spill and reload around the helper.

Out-of-line SSE helpers are renamed ...Ool behind always_inline wrappers
that pass copies, so the locals do not escape; Comi gets an inline
lazy-flags path. Suite 59/59 in WSL; FFXII int64 and sse64 oracles 0
failed, native and SoftFloat.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
